# Opting the pick-rate feature INTO a build.
#
# Selected with `vite build --mode pickrates` (see the build:pickrates / desktop:*
# :pickrates npm scripts) rather than an inline environment variable, because that
# syntax is not portable to Windows shells — and this project releases from Windows.
#
# Without this mode the feature is absent: no toggle, no fetch, and vite.config.ts
# also drops data/pick-rates/ out of dist. See docs/PICK_RATES.md.
VITE_PICK_RATES=1
